From cf722dc42649190711b146b47be1be979a0d74ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:09:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Wire existing PubPartner cartridge, avatar, guidance and
 session provider workflows

Brought from Beyond-October main onto pre-dec claude/eq-foundations-2026-11-23
at the owner's request (Nov 27). Original message:

Use existing subsystem routes and privacy boundaries; preserve safe provider
settings on resumed sessions; connect cartridge partners to calibration.
Model-free regression tests added. Python/browser runtime verification still
pending.

Clash resolved in modules/pubpartner_core.py (run_turn, provider dispatch):
kept the EQ branch's Blackbox witness (turn_started, and turn_failed on any
error) and moved Beyond-October's saved-provider lookup for resumed sessions
inside that witnessed block, so the resumed session's provider is used and a
failure while looking it up is still recorded.

(cherry picked from commit 6cba39bccd09b331210385e4302a56e272ec0f50)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
